    <guid isPermaLink="false">699f76fede29766da98d0539</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Feb 2026 22:34:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天的节目呈现的是三位主播在上一期中推荐的七首早期浪漫主义时期的佳作。我们将依次播放贝多芬，肖邦，舒曼，格林卡和门德尔松的作品。它们或温柔低语，或热烈倾诉，在旋律与和声的流动中，展现出十九世纪音乐特有的细腻、幻想与深情。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望听众朋友们能够喜欢！</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏱️时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">00:01</a> 节目介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">01:07</a> 贝多芬：F大调浪漫曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="582">09:42</a> 肖邦：降E大调夜曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="844">14:04</a> 肖邦：升c小调夜曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1104">18:24</a> 舒曼：幻想曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> 格林卡：鲁斯兰与柳德米拉序曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1553">25:53</a> 舒曼：钢琴套曲《蝴蝶》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2504">41:44</a> 门德尔松：e小调小提琴协奏曲</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【相关单集】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6985135d70aae7e967cc48db" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6985135d70aae7e967cc48db"><span>EP17: 超迷人的浪漫主义早期音乐 - 六首画面感十足的心动曲目</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/690fd79faf4fc00da7cacbf3" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/690fd79faf4fc00da7cacbf3"><span>PL03: 播放曲单 - 六首古典时期推荐作品</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68de58888e321a0d6fb39c89" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68de58888e321a0d6fb39c89"><span>PL01: 播放曲单 - 六首巴洛克杰作</span></a></p>]]></description>
