    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天的节目由三位主播在上一期中推荐的六首古典时期经典作品组成。我们按照节目中推荐的顺序，依次播放莫扎特，海顿和波切里尼的六首脍炙人口的佳作。希望听众朋友们能够喜欢！</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏱️时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">00:01</a> 节目介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 莫扎特：d小调钢琴协奏曲第20号，K466</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 第一乐章 - 快板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="991">16:31</a> 第二乐章 - 浪漫曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1531">25:31</a> 第三乐章 - 很快的快板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2034">33:54</a> 莫扎特：G大调小夜曲，K525</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2034">33:54</a> 第一乐章 - 快板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2356">39:16</a> 第二乐章 - 行板：浪漫曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2682">44:42</a> 第三乐章 - 小步舞曲：小快板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2807">46:47</a> 第四乐章 - 终曲：回旋曲式快板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3112">51:52</a> 海顿：降E大调小号协奏曲，Hob. Vlle/1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3112">51:52</a> 第一乐章 - 快板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3481">58:01</a> 第二乐章 - 行板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3683">61:23</a> 第三乐章 - 回旋曲式快板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3932">65:32</a> 海顿：升f小调第45交响曲，K525</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3932">65:32</a> 第一乐章 - 很快的快板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4241">70:41</a> 第二乐章 - 广板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4721">78:41</a> 第三乐章 - 小步舞曲与中段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494